ot-cast (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Treeland ScreenCast (TreelandCapture via xdg-desktop-portal). Tmall
    MagicBox DLNA picture + AAC measured. Xiaomi Pad WFD picture
    measured. Treeland WFD audio is further investigation.
  * Do not SET AAC when the sink lists only LPCM (that Pad decoded AAC
    as PCM). Keep LPCM in SET_PARAMETER. X11 LPCM is unchanged.
  * Park generic Wayland PortalCapture. DDE sessions are Treeland or
    X11. File cast still skips capture.

 -- Playhi <000902play@gmail.com>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 21:56:26 +0800

ot-cast (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Send a local video, photo, or audio file. DLNA serves the file over
    HTTP with Range; Miracast transcodes it into WFD RTP.
  * Mux WFD LPCM (48 kHz pcm_bluray) when the sink lists LPCM and not
    AAC. Video-only remains valid if neither codec is available.
  * Keep DLNA live MPEG-TS flowing across the sink's first probe GET:
    start the encoder on Play, copy ffmpeg stdout with a member slot
    so Qt UniqueConnection no longer drops the stream.

 -- Playhi <000902play@gmail.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:25:12 +0800

ot-cast (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * DDE quick panel (libot-cast-tray.so): scan and connect through the
    ot-cast D-Bus API. The plugin does not talk to NetworkManager or
    GStreamer.
  * ot-cast --background for tray-started sessions; pairing still
    raises the main window.

 -- Playhi <000902play@gmail.com>  Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:30:23 +0800

ot-cast (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public release of Cast (ot-cast, com.01tool.cast).
  * X11 sender: selected monitor, optional AAC from the Pulse/PipeWire
    default-sink monitor.
  * Miracast: NetworkManager P2P scan, WPS PIN/PBC pairing, WFD/RTSP
    and H.264 MPEG-TS over RTP.
  * DLNA: SSDP MediaRenderer discovery, live HTTP MPEG-TS (1080p30,
    HD profile) and AVTransport Play. Each row is labeled Miracast or
    DLNA.
  * DTK6 UI with zh_CN and zh_TW. Wayland capture is stubbed.
  * DDE quick panel: scan and connect via the ot-cast D-Bus API.

 -- Playhi <000902play@gmail.com>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:55:32 +0800
